+  built `.next/static` assets (it fails loudly when the dashboard is not built).
+- Default config holds no vendor key: `OBLIEN_CLIENT_ID` and `OBLIEN_CLIENT_SECRET`
+  removed from apps/api/.env.example (they are read only under CLOUD_MODE). The
+  platform makes no model call; nothing routes to OpenVault `/v1` because there is
