+- Strings that name services upstream operates and FreeBuild does not: "Openship Cloud",
+  the "Openship GitHub App", "Sign in with Openship", the "Openship Desktop" OAuth app
+  name, openship.io URLs and the SMTP_FROM default `Openship <noreply@openship.io>`.
+- User-visible Openship in apps/api (MCP tool descriptions, route text), packages/platform,
